{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o115a","title":"白狼山之战","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o115a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹军登白狼山猝遇乌丸，曹操见敌阵不整，遣张辽为先锋突击，大破敌众，斩蹋顿等，胡汉二十余万人降。","evidence":["wudi-e-o115a-q"]},{"id":"zhangle-e-o005a-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"张辽劝战受麾破军斩蹋顿","evidence":["zhangle-e-o005a-q"]},{"id":"chengguo-a-9ceb0487e2c849488b0b","label":"正文","text":"太祖大破乌丸斩蹋顿尚熙走辽东","evidence":["chengguo-q-f9c4f11ad7b9d646ecde"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-9f98ec10601dada9401c","label":"正文","text":"时方夏水雨滨海洿下泞滞不通，虏遮守蹊要，军不得进","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-45ec1ef7188ccff17ffb"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-0164469595cf4bd54ef1","label":"正文","text":"太祖患之以问田畴，畴献从卢龙口越白檀之险掩其不备之策，太祖曰善","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-6e1523aa8e9ef53db85e"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-0379b2e2998408d49f63","label":"正文","text":"太祖引军还，署大木表于水侧路傍佯言俟秋冬乃复进军，虏候骑见之诚以为大军去","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-5efa41d4716cdb95cd7c"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-ccee5536101217351f41","label":"正文","text":"太祖令田畴将其众为乡导，上徐无山出卢龙历平冈登白狼堆","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-0fe6aac28fd2583f8d1f"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-6f76caa670acc8e271a2","label":"正文","text":"去柳城二百余里虏乃惊觉，单于身自临阵，太祖与交战，大斩获追奔逐北至柳城","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-f07b52453e2f5ec01671"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-339a418563743c7cf941","label":"正文","text":"《邢颙传》在田畴称邢颙为民之先觉后，接述乃见太祖、求为乡导、以克柳城。","evidence":["cuimao-q-69c5e437775b3b1d6258","cuimao-q2-d2539b23436915829033"]},{"id":"wuhuan-a-7540a1d14d656e011019","label":"正文","text":"太祖潜师北伐乌丸，出其不意一战而定之，夷狄慑服，威振朔土","evidence":["wuhuan-q-1b9d3c0a0627d456e821"]},{"id":"wuhuan-a-be163c0af11afee80808","label":"正文","text":"建安十二年，太祖自征蹋顿于柳城，潜军诡道，于凡城击破袁尚、蹋顿之众，临阵斩蹋顿首","evidence":["wuhuan-q-a7365f0d45ef197d3704"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"指挥","evidence":["wudi-e-o115a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0178","role":"先锋","evidence":["wudi-e-o115a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0240","role":"战死","evidence":["wudi-e-o115a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"与兄熙走辽东","evidence":["chengguo-q-f9c4f11ad7b9d646ecde"]},{"person":"wudi-p0221","role":"走辽东","evidence":["chengguo-q-f9c4f11ad7b9d646ecde"]},{"person":"wudi-p0243","role":"献策旧北平郡治在平冈道出卢龙达于柳城，尚有微径可从，若默回军从卢龙口越白檀之险出空虚之地，掩其不备，蹋顿之首可不战而擒；上徐无山，出卢龙，历平冈，登白狼堆","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-6e1523aa8e9ef53db85e","yuanzhang-q-0fe6aac28fd2583f8d1f"]}],"place":{"text":"白狼山","evidence":["wudi-e-o115a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安十二年八月","year":207,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o115a-q","wudi-q-o111","wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df"],"chronology":"wudi-y207","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o111","basis":"建安十二年八月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,635,"O115a"],"order":256}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0178","name":"张辽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0198","name":"袁尚","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0221","name":"袁熙","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0240","name":"蹋顿","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0243","name":"田畴","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-f9c4f11ad7b9d646ecde","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-55586c7cf2d6a29214ad","layer":"original","quote":"太祖乃密出卢龙塞，直指单于庭。虏猝闻太祖至，惶怖合战。大破之，斩蹋顿及名王以下〖11〗。尚及兄熙走辽东","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":281,"end":332,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-69c5e437775b3b1d6258","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-fcee2600a748b8b0406a","layer":"original","quote":"田畴曰：“邢颙，民之先觉也。”乃见太祖，求为乡导，以克柳城","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":114,"end":143,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-d2539b23436915829033","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-fcee2600a748b8b0406a","layer":"original","quote":"邢颙，字子昂，河间鄚人也〖1〗。举孝廉，司徒辟，皆不就。易姓字，适右北平，从田畴游。积五年，而太祖定冀州；颙谓畴曰：“黄巾起来二十余年〖2〗，海内鼎沸，百姓流离。今闻曹公法令严；民厌乱矣，乱极则平：请以身先。”遂装还乡里〖3〗。田畴曰：“邢颙，民之先觉也。”乃见太祖，求为乡导，以克柳城。","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":144,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o115a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1a17e5b34add834e2d76","layer":"original","quote":"八月，登白狼山〖11〗，猝与虏遇〖12〗。众甚盛。公车重在后，被甲者少〖13〗；左右皆惧。公登高，望虏阵不整，乃纵兵击之，使张辽为先锋；虏众大崩；斩蹋顿及名王以下〖14〗，胡、汉降者二十余万口。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":634,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十二年：建安十二年（公元 207）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":623,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-20efb4f3aff50357a189","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o111","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01eaf58b917a530c61d5","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春二月〖1〗，公自淳于还邺。丁酉〖2〗，令曰：“吾起义兵诛暴乱，于今十九年；所征必克，岂吾功哉？乃贤士大夫之力也！天下虽未悉定，吾当要与贤士大夫共定之；而专享其劳〖3〗，吾何以安焉？其促定功行封〖4〗。”于是大封功臣二十余人，皆为列侯；其余各以次受封；及复死事之孤〖5〗：轻重各有差〖6〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":621,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-1b9d3c0a0627d456e821","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-ae68c64cc471b15b9686","layer":"original","quote":"太祖潜师北伐，出其不意，一战而定之；夷狄慑服，威振朔土","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":94,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-a7365f0d45ef197d3704","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-2a3e7083cec67ed88076","layer":"original","quote":"建安十（一）〔二〕年，太祖自征蹋顿于柳城；潜军诡道〖9〗，未至百余里，虏乃觉。尚与蹋顿将众逆战于凡城〖10〗，兵马甚盛。太祖登高，望虏阵，（柳）〔抑〕军未进；观其小动，乃击破其众；临阵斩蹋顿首，死者被野","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":101,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-0fe6aac28fd2583f8d1f","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-12c592fb65c1e837ed4b","layer":"original","quote":"太祖令畴将其众为乡导，上徐无山，出卢龙，历平冈，登白狼堆","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":278,"end":306,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-45ec1ef7188ccff17ffb","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-12c592fb65c1e837ed4b","layer":"original","quote":"时方夏，水雨，而滨海洿下〖8〗，泞滞不通；虏亦遮守蹊要〖9〗，军不得进","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-5efa41d4716cdb95cd7c","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-12c592fb65c1e837ed4b","layer":"original","quote":"乃引军还，而署大木表于水侧路傍曰〖15〗：“方今暑（夏）〔雨〕，道路不通；且俟秋冬，乃复进军。”虏候骑见之〖16〗，诚以为大军去也","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":212,"end":277,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-6e1523aa8e9ef53db85e","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-12c592fb65c1e837ed4b","layer":"original","quote":"太祖患之，以问畴。畴曰：“此道，秋夏每常有水；浅不通车马，深不载舟船，为难久矣！旧北平郡治在平冈〖10〗，道出卢龙，达于柳城；自建武以来〖11〗，陷坏断绝，垂二百载〖12〗，而尚有微径可从。今虏将以大军当由无终，不得进而退，懈弛无备。若默回军，从卢龙口越白檀之险〖13〗，出空虚之地，路近而便；掩其不备，蹋顿之首可不战而擒也〖14〗。”太祖曰：“善！”","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":212,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-f07b52453e2f5ec01671","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-12c592fb65c1e837ed4b","layer":"original","quote":"去柳城二百余里，虏乃惊觉。单于身自临阵，太祖与交战；遂大斩获，追奔逐北，至柳城","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":307,"end":346,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o005a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-5f877be849f750b12973","layer":"original","quote":"从征袁尚于柳城，猝与虏遇；辽劝太祖战，气甚奋。太祖壮之，自以所持麾授辽〖8〗；遂击，大破之，斩单于蹋顿。﹝一﹞","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
